    "body": "Here is a template project reproducing the issue:\r\n[compose-multiplatform.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18219207/compose-multiplatform.zip)\r\n\r\n1. Run the app on iOS Simulator (iPhone or iPad)\r\n2. Click the plus FAB button to add list item.\r\n3. Tap on list item.\r\n4. Change date.\r\n\r\nApp crashes with exception from previous message.\r\n\r\nThe date picker code is in `AladinDateAlert` which is used from `UserListScreen`. @MohamedRejeb Any idea what is wrong here? Is it in the lib or the app?",
