          "merged_at": "2024-12-29T08:31:41Z"
        },
        "body": "closes #210 \r\nThis pull request includes significant updates to the `DatePickerManager` and `TimePickerManager` classes in the `calf-ui` module for iOS. The changes focus on refactoring the code to improve the handling of date and time picker events by using `NSObject` delegates.\r\n\r\nRefactoring for event handling:\r\n\r\n* [`calf-ui/src/iosMain/kotlin/com/mohamedrejeb/calf/ui/datepicker/DatePickerManager.kt`](diffhunk://#diff-d2f928e8724cf34e82ed2fbf52d95d9791909792d839b027450771beb2933e77L44-R50): Replaced the use of method pointers and direct actions with an `NSObject` delegate to handle the date change events in the `DatePickerManager` class. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-d2f928e8724cf34e82ed2fbf52d95d9791909792d839b027450771beb2933e77L44-R50) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-d2f928e8724cf34e82ed2fbf52d95d9791909792d839b027450771beb2933e77L95-R102)\r\n* [`calf-ui/src/iosMain/kotlin/com/mohamedrejeb/calf/ui/timepicker/TimePickerManager.kt`](diffhunk://#diff-ca3f00218d999f9179b96e94c7654f719a3387b29664e72d50bd43e2c0ffcf6dL23-R67): Similarly, replaced the use of method pointers and direct actions with an `NSObject` delegate to handle the time change events in the `TimePickerManager` class.\r\n",
